<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>Sample results from Stable Diffusion 3.5 fine-tuned with each heuristic. Prompts were not seen during training to evaluate generalization. All images are generated with identical settings (seed, sampler, steps, guidance); each heuristic is shown at its optimal trained <math id="A6.F11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
